1
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,160
Is anyone here?

2
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,160
Officer Cao.

3
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:19,100
What can I do

4
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:20,280
for you?

5
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:21,720
Dr. Yang,

6
00:01:22,039 --> 00:01:23,039
let's have a chat.

7
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:24,460
Have a seat.

8
00:01:32,039 --> 00:01:33,170
Teng Xiaohu is dead.

9
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:34,800
Dead?

10
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,720
Please calm down.

11
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:42,759
I'm fine.

12
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,400
Calm down.

13
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,039
How did he die?

14
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:50,840
Teng Xiaohu

15
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,610
was strangled to death.

16
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,800
The body was found

17
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,560
in a cabin in the forest farm.

18
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,440
The time of death

19
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,280
was about five days ago.

20
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,440
Where were you

21
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:02,800
that day?

22
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,500
I was at the clinic the whole time.

23
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,040
After Dr. Song left,

24
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,759
I was alone at the clinic.

25
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,820
I also slept here at night.

26
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,800
If you don't believe me,

27
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,960
you can ask Aunt Wang at the convenience store next door.

28
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,090
She can vouch for me.

29
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,840
Don't be nervous.

30
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,250
This is just a routine inquiry.

31
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:22,720
When was the last time

32
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,170
you saw Teng Xiaohu?

33
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,160
It was the night the forest farm caught fire.

34
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,960
He came over with some injuries.

35
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,800
I treated him,

36
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,170
and then I let him go.

37
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,920
I haven't seen him since.

38
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,050
We will verify that.

39
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,410
If you think of any clues later,

40
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,690
contact us anytime.

41
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,280
Officer Cao,

42
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,700
I think there's something

43
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:51,920
I need to tell you.

44
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,960
Xuefei.

45
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,240
There's something

46
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,600
that's a bit presumptuous.

47
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,330
You might get angry hearing it,

48
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,320
but I still hope you can help.

49
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,890
Does it have to do with our investigation?

50
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,600
Then tell me.

51
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,800
I want to go to your house,

52
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,720
the one your father lives in.

53
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:13,840
And

54
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,930
it has to be when he's not there.

55
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,560
Wang Hong.

56
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:47,420
Let me do it.

57
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:13,840
Emergency rescue personnel and police

58
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:11,760
officers quickly rushed to the accident scene,

59
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,360
Teng Laohu.

60
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,800
Where is your son, Xiaohu?

61
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,360
We found him.

62
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:25,640
He's gone.

63
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,040
Just give it a rest.

64
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:39,200
I can't.

65
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,280
Give it a rest.

66
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,880
Are you coming back for dinner tonight?

67
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,130
I had the kitchen stew some pork bones for you.

68
00:06:47,159 --> 00:06:48,600
Xiaohu hasn't been found yet.

69
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,800
That's my lifeblood.

70
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,440
What will he do if I leave?

71
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:57,620
We are also investigating

72
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,480
this case.

73
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,360
The prime suspect

74
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,490
has been confirmed.

75
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:05,730
We will close the case as soon as possible.

76
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,800
That's all for today.

77
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:20,520
Officer Cao.

78
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:42,140
Rose Language.

79
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,180
Chief Zhou.

80
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,200
Based on the comparison by the technical department,

81
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,560
the handwriting on the cargo owner's note

82
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:06,320
from the car bombing 16 years ago,

83
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,680
provided by detainee Chen Lu,

84
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:09,640
highly matches the handwriting

85
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:10,800
on the private letters

86
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,200
we found in Li Zhijun's home.

87
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,920
We can basically determine that they were written by the same person.

88
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:17,160
Combined with the testimony of witness Yang Songman,

89
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,760
Teng Xiaohu revealed before his death

90
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,000
that he was going to find someone.

91
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,080
Old Song, the director of Xiaoheyan Clinic,

92
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:23,040
before his death,

93
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:25,760
left a testimony regarding the bombing back then,

94
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,320
confirming that on the day of the incident,

95
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,560
at Xiaoheyan Clinic,

96
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,920
he saw a bald man

97
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,080
with a head injury from the explosion.

98
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:33,880
This matches the testimony of Zhao Zhiguo's son, Zhao Long.

99
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,559
We have sufficient reason to suspect

100
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:37,320
that Li Zhijun, the boss of Zhijun Processing Factory,

101
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,320
is a major suspect in the bombing

102
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:40,000
of Zhao Zhiguo's family 16 years ago,

103
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,039
the disappearance of Wu Mingyue,

104
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:41,799
and the recent

105
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,640
murder of Teng Xiaohu.

106
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,520
Eyewitnesses saw Li Zhijun.

107
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:50,000
Go deep into the east side of the woods.

108
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,000
The situation is urgent.

109
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,320
I am now applying for a dragnet search

110
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,440
of the areas where Li Zhijun

111
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:55,320
might hide people and criminal evidence,

112
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:58,320
especially the remote areas

113
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,800
in the northeast of the woods.

114
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,600
This is the search application.

115
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,680
Back then,

116
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,560
technology was backward

117
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:06,820
and evidence collection was difficult.

118
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,000
We indeed

119
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,480
let the victims suffer injustice

120
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,840
and let the real culprit

121
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,840
go unpunished.

122
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,560
This is a dereliction of our duty

123
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,680
and a debt of history.

124
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,000
It's a new century.

125
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,920
Since we wear this police uniform,

126
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:35,080
we must not only solve new cases,

127
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:38,770
but also have the courage to clear up these old, unsolved cases.

128
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,600
To give history an answer,

129
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,490
and justice to the victims.

130
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:43,960
We must let all the truth

131
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,160
come to light.

132
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:46,880
Approved.

133
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,360
Mobilize the police force,

134
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,320
coordinate with the Forest Protection Section and head into the mountains.

135
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,450
Be sure to stay safe.

136
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,880
You must find the person,

137
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,240
and the evidence.

138
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:02,010
I promise to complete the mission.

139
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:05,800
Back then, when Lin Shengli just took over his family's factory,

140
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:08,660
he came back with an order from a big boss out of town.

141
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:11,560
Me, Li Zhijun, and Lin Shengli

142
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,960
were all fighting for it.

143
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,650
In the end, none of us got it.

144
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,700
It fell into Zhao Zhiguo's hands.

145
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:19,660
After the incident with the Zhao family,

146
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:22,690
I thought no one wanted that batch of wood anyway,

147
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:25,570
so I asked Liu Guang and Liu Ming to help me find it.

148
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,920
I didn't expect

149
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,260
it would lead to what happened to that girl and her husband.

150
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,320
This forest

151
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:34,880
eats people.

152
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,520
This mountain

153
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,290
eats people too.

154
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,260
It eats honest people,

155
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,220
and it eats wicked people.

156
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,700
My son was eaten by this mountain.

157
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,120
Who did what,

158
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,120
this mountain remembers it all.

159
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:53,520
Take a rest.

160
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,160
Every tree

161
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,280
and every snowflake

162
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,480
is keeping score for him.

163
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,010
Brother,

164
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,320
can we find it?

165
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:06,380
We have to find it even if we can't.

166
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,360
For this day,

167
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:10,800
many people have waited a long time.

168
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,330
Let's go.

169
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,080
Uncle San.

170
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,740
You take Chen Nian and Er Gui up first.

171
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:25,010
Today is actually my birthday.

172
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,720
Time flies so fast.

173
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,340
You know, the two of us,

174
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,880
in the blink of an eye,

175
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,890
have spent most of our lives together.

176
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:58,400
Do you remember what day it is today?

177
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:02,890
It's Xuefei's birthday today.

178
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,280
Our daughter

179
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:05,800
is 27 now.

180
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:15,010
I miss our daughter.

181
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:19,770
You want some candy?

182
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,720
Okay, don't rush.

183
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,780
I'll get it for you.

184
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,620
Here you go.

185
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,840
Two pink ones,

186
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,400
three white ones.

187
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,920
Swallowing them dry?

188
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,480
Why are you in such a hurry?

189
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,760
At your age,

190
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,660
you still act like a child.

191
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,660
Here, wash it down.

192
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:29,840
Alright.

193
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,080
Look at you.

194
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,240
All dressed up,

195
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,520
don't you look pretty?

196
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,860
Want to see your daughter?

197
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,620
I'll take you to see her later.

198
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,300
Hiding someone in this old forest

199
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,760
is like looking for a needle in a haystack.

200
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,090
Li Zhijun, that old fox,

201
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,600
I really didn't expect this.

202
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,240
Girl.

203
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:31,320
Where are you?

204
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,000
I'm at the log yard.

205
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,970
Today is your birthday.

206
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:36,520
Your mom and I

207
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,360
are giving you a birthday present.

208
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,760
Where did you hide my mom?

209
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,520
Look up at the sky.

210
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,120
Over there.

211
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,800
Attention everyone,

212
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:56,400
converge on the fireworks in the East District.

213
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:58,460
Li Zhijun might have a hostage ahead.

214
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:00,300
Make sure the hostage is safe.

215
00:15:00,520 --> 00:15:01,040
Hurry.

216
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:08,320
Take a breath.

217
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:09,360
I'll go first.
